"k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"Multi-GPU **inside one node** uses SHM/P2P. Multi-node uses the QSFP fabric:"},"3441":{"id":"/learn-27","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"Topology"},"3442":{"id":"/learn-28","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"What to set"},"3443":{"id":"/learn-29","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"2-node pair"},"3444":{"id":"/learn-30","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"`group_vars` `highspeed_*` / `nccl_env` (one 200 Gb/s QSFP cable)"},"3445":{"id":"/learn-31","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"3-node ring"},"3446":{"id":"/learn-32","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"Overlay Jobs only — OOB 10GbE + four RoCE HCAs. **Not** the pair env"},"3447":{"id":"/learn-33","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"4/5-node switch"},"3448":{"id":"/learn-34","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"Generated per-node netplan (one RoCE /24 per node, CRS804). **Not** the pair env"},"3449":{"id":"/learn-35","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"Interconnect & NCCL"},"3450":{"id":"/learn-36","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#why-no-auto-start","content":"Heavy Jobs use `restartPolicy: OnFailure` (or `Never`) and a low `backoffLimit`. After reboot the cluster is empty until y